}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "a867edc2-7d3a-5fbc-b2ed-43a1f2230791" :question/math-academy-id "q-22067" :question/problem "Let\n$A=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 3 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.$\nWhat are the dimensions of $BA?$" :question/worked-solution "We notice that $A$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix and $B$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix. \n\nThere are $4$ columns in $B$ and $4$ rows in $A.$ Since the number of columns in $B$ equals the number of rows in $A,$ the matrices $B$ and $A$ are conformable for multiplication. \n\nThe product $BA$ has dimensions $2\\times 2:$\n\n$$\n{B}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\times }_{✓}{A}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 2}={BA}_{2\\times 2}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265741 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "41f2ba8f-39a4-580c-ad74-ddae65c3bc2b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\times 4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263584} {:answer/id #uuid "4cdc1dda-985c-531a-8198-2e27932a7782" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\times 2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263665} {:answer/id #uuid "5bf479a9-e9bb-5032-8ddc-7c1d3f7834d7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "The product is undefined" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263793} {:answer/id #uuid "c5405d8a-672b-5d09-add2-c80683011f7e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\times 4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264729} {:answer/id #uuid "e5c61767-151e-587f-88e5-2671dc04c89d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4\\times 4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265003}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c5405d8a-672b-5d09-add2-c80683011f7e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2\\times 4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264729} :answer-field/id #uuid "64117ea8-fc6f-5546-9e96-d9551685168e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {: