f-3da3-56ec-8846-70fae5eeab59" :question/math-academy-id "q-1034" :question/problem "Find $AB$, if\n$A = \\begin{bmatrix}5 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$B = \\begin{bmatrix}6 & 5 \\\\ 9 & 8 \\\\ 3 & 7\\end{bmatrix}$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237990 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0172af46-e351-502b-aa3a-c62166a7ed72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -2 \\\\ -15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235806} {:answer/id #uuid "12333d71-f54d-5f6e-9e6c-5fc764d2bc80" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 9 \\\\ -15 & 18\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235924} {:answer/id #uuid "442b8d6f-cd03-5b5a-84f1-23d1ca97ea2f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -2 \\\\ 9 & 15\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236256} {:answer/id #uuid "7b37a294-1d3c-567d-bf66-b3920a5fe9a4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -2 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236585} {:answer/id #uuid "8ce9cddf-2413-5e15-89c7-45b259cab3b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236707}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8ce9cddf-2413-5e15-89c7-45b259cab3b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236707} :answer-field/id #uuid "a44f4bb4-30a2-5a30-959a-18587874cdc3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237655}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "53274149-3160-5be4-b6eb-415d49f449f3" :question/math-academy-id "q-1033" :question/problem "If\n$E=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$\nand\n$F=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$\nthen $EF=$" :question/worked-solution "Here, $E$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix and $F$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $4$ columns in $E$ and $4$ rows in $F,$ so $E$ and $F$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{E}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{F}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 2}={EF}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $EF,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,2=1\\cdot 4+(-2)\\cdot (-3)+4\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 0 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,18=1\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot (-1)+4\\cdot 1+5\\cdot 2 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,15=3\\cdot 4+(-1)\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 0 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,9=3\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 1+1\\cdot 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$EF=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186238011 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f7a62ec-13b8-543d-9616-121868053523" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}20 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236016} {:answer/id #uuid "22e57d49-7fd7-563f-abb5-64190ff4aa02" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}20 & 24 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236039} {:answer/id #uuid "