\nThere is $1$ column in $A$ and $1$ row in $B,$ so $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication: \n\n$$\n{A}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}={AB}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-4=2\\cdot -2 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,6=2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,2=-1\\cdot -2 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-3=-1\\cdot 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$AB=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292867 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ca215ee-0623-587b-9023-3636cc2853da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290882}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3ca215ee-0623-587b-9023-3636cc2853da" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290882} :answer-field/id #uuid "5bc062b7-2d6b-5f91-84df-fab4dc97bf7f" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292012} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf79a280-af12-5e3c-8918-f31f6f1692f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291456}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bf79a280-af12-5e3c-8918-f31f6f1692f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291456} :answer-field/id #uuid "6d575b22-c24d-5b71-b048-2d6821f5eb59" :answer-field/key "field-